    { id: "GS7", severity: "medium", tag: "CONTRADICTION",
      what: "S1_operations.md §8 attributes 'A0-A5' collectively to
          covenant.vsm — but A3/A5 actually live in covenant_ops.vsm, not
          covenant.vsm. Conflating the two undermines the rationale for the
          B+ two-doc split (isolating A0's audit/edit surface)." },
    { id: "GS8", severity: "medium", tag: "INCOMPLETE",
      what: "S3_control.md §4's own constraint list omits A3 (budget
          ceiling) and A6 (variety/Cyberfilter) despite S3 being the
          subsystem those two axioms are literally about, per concepts.md
          and covenant_ops.vsm themselves." },
    { id: "GS9", severity: "medium", tag: "STALE_RISK_UNCONFIRMED",
      what: "S3_control.md's S3_C2 ('S3 modules do not call Ollama/Qwen')
          may be contradicted by the 2026-07-05 QWEN-LOCATION-DRIFT finding
          (ollama on LXC 101, the S3-hosting node). CLAUDE.md notes 'stop
