    { id: "GS10", severity: "medium", tag: "INCONSISTENCY",
      what: "Identifier collision: CLAUDE.md's 'D7 = all committed files in
          English' vs. concepts.md's 'D7 = the 5 views defined for
          opsroom' — same label, unrelated referents (mirrors CT8's opsroom
          finding from the other fork, independently found)." },
    { id: "GS11", severity: "medium", tag: "STALE",
      what: "All 5 docs/theory/systems/*.md files share one batch date
          (2026-05-24) with zero content revision since, despite ~2 months
          of major changes to exactly what they describe (escalation
          logic, decision-auth, S4 wiring). No versioning discipline
