    { id: "GS12", severity: "low", tag: "TRACKED_ELSEWHERE",
      what: "strategy.vsm's own 2026-07-31 addendum already flags two open
          questions (Anthropic disclosure timeline undefined; SD3 scope re:
          sibling public repos) — both still unresolved, now 3 days
